# Third-party checkouts are acquired separately; keep versions in research references.
# 排除「内容」而不是「目录」：写成 /resources/repos/ 会连目录本身一起排除，git 便不会下降
# 进去，内层 .gitignore 的否定规则（!index.csv）就全部失效。实测见 resources/repos/.gitignore。


# Local credentials. Keep safe examples versioned.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.vscode/

# Re-creatable runtime data; research evidence and provenance remain versioned.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
# Rivet 运行时状态：本地数据库、备份、缓存与技能草稿不入库。
/.rivet/
# WorkBuddy 的工作日志属于本地过程记录，不是研究内容，整体不入库。
/.workbuddy-ai/
/.workbuddy/
# 论文原件、转换正文、图片与运行日志不入库；索引和文档保留。
/resources/papers/pdf/
/resources/papers/md/
/resources/papers/assets/
/resources/papers/logs/
/resources/repos/*
/resources/courses/*
/analysis/archive/**/main_agent_context*
/analysis/archive/**/id_to_doc*

# Editor recovery files and OS metadata.
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

/以前的/*
